LOCATION:NOIR café\, Graefestraße 82\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: !!! Next Milonguita 5.12. !!!\n==============\n\n\nNOI
 RCAFÉ Saturday Dinner Menue \nStandard Menue\n----------\nLa Milonguita N
 ota Negra \nThe darker the night\, the sweeter the dance.\n\n- Entrée 2 
 € — donations welcome\nAperitif — 18:00–19:00\n\nPRACTICA\nStarter
 \nA taste of tango walking\, seasoned with rhythm — exploring which step
 s and styles pair best with each piece of music.\n\n- This week: Lucianita
  and Kojo\nA first sip of rhythm- a slow awakening for the senses\n\n- Mai
 n Course — 19:00–22:00\n\nLa Milonguita Nota Negra\nA rich blend of Ar
 gentine classics and hidden gems\, carefully seasoned by DJ mojokojo\, del
 icately seasoned with a musical interlude by our special guest \;)…\n\nB
 est enjoyed with dr\ninks\, served alongside with tempting bites \;)…\n\
 nLean in. Let the night melt on your tongue\, each step a lingering bite o
 f dark chocolate\, each glance a sip of red wine\, let your steps follow t
 he flavor of the music. \n\nNOIRcafé\, Graefestraße 82\n10967 Berlin\n--
 --------\nQuelle: https://www.facebook.com/philip.kojo.96\n\nVeranstalter:
  Philip Kojo \n\nhttps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/498561/La-M
 ilonguita-Nota-Negra
